# Agent history (append each run)

- **agent-history.md** at the repo root is the run log for AI agents.
- **At the end of every task or session**, append agent-history.md with a new dated section that summarizes:
  - What was done (features, fixes, refactors)
  - Key decisions or conventions
  - Any troubleshooting (errors, resolutions)
- Do not remove or overwrite past entries; only append.
- The old workflow doc is **WSL/docs/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md**; it is legacy and should not be updated. Use agent-history.md for new run notes.
